OL,3,GNEWSA1866 storm rescue recreation part
OL,4,Aof  festivities
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lifeboat station is set to recreate
OL,7,Fdramatic rescue efforts from a huge
OL,8,Fstorm160 years ago as part of a day of
OL,9,Ffestivities.
OL,11,FTorbay's first lifeboat station was set
OL,12,Fup a few months after the great storm
OL,13,Fof 1866, and is celebrating its
OL,14,Fanniversary on Saturday with an event
OL,15,Fcalled StormFest 160.
OL,17,FVolunteers and crews from across south
OL,18,FDevon are taking part in StormFest,
OL,19,Fwhich will include a traditional gig
OL,20,Fboat pull, a lifeboat flotilla and a
OL,21,Fcommemoration service.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
