OL,3,GNEWSA1866 storm rescue recreation part
OL,4,Aof  festivities
OL,5,
OL,6,FTorbay RNLI coxswain Richard Fowler
OL,7,Fsaid: "We've got a really special day
OL,8,Fof events planned for Teignmouth,
OL,9,FTorquay and Brixham - it's been a real
OL,10,Fcommunity effort to put it all
OL,11,Ftogether."
